@*
    ── משאבים (Mentor) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    The mentor gets THE SAME Resources product as the lecturer — the approved
    screen in ResourcesLibrary, not a mentor variant of it. Search, the
    "רלוונטי לתקופה בקורס" strip, the category chips, the resource cards and
    the detail panel are all the identical components; role changes what the
    user may DO, not what the screen looks like.

    READ-ONLY, BY CONSTRUCTION
      • CanManage is false — no "ניהול משאבים" link, no empty-state CTA, and
        no other route into the management UI. (Those routes are Admin/Staff
        only anyway; this just stops offering the mentor a locked door.)
      • The only actions reachable from here are the read ones the shared
        detail panel exposes: download, open in a new tab, play a video.
      • GetForMentorAsync reads api/mentor/resources — the read-only endpoint
        added for this role. api/resourcefiles is Admin/Staff and would 403.
        Nothing was widened to share the screen.

    THE STAGE STRIP IS MENTOR-SCOPED
    The stage resolver asks api/dashboard at mentor scope, which the server
    resolves from the caller's roles, so "the current stage" is derived from
    the projects this mentor actually supervises — not from the whole cohort.

    FAVOURITES stay on the mentor's own localStorage key, as before, and are
    still device-local: no endpoint persists a per-user resource preference.
*@

@page "/mentor/resources"
@layout AppLayout
@attribute [Authorize(Roles = Roles.Mentor + "," + Roles.Admin + "," + Roles.Staff)]
@namespace AuthWithAdmin.Client.Pages.Mentor
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization
@using AuthWithAdmin.Client.Pages.Learning
@using AuthWithAdmin.Client.Services

@inject IResourceFilesService     ResourceFilesService
@inject IDashboardOverviewService DashboardService

<ResourcesLibrary Title="משאבים"
                  Subtitle="נהלים, מחוונים וחומרי הוראה — לכל הקורס"
                  Loader="ResourceFilesService.GetForMentorAsync"
                  FavoritesKey="motiva.mentor.resources.favorites"
                  CurrentStageLoader='@ResourceStageSources.FromDashboardOverview(DashboardService, "mentor")'
                  CanManage="false"
                  EmptyDescription="כשצוות הקורס יעלה מדריכים, טפסים או מסמכים, הם יופיעו כאן." />
